      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Let me check what `EnumHeader` is defined as.Let me check if there's a compile script in the working directory.Now I have a full picture. The improvements needed are:\n- Remove unused imports (ArrayList, List, Map, TreeMap, ConcurrentHashMap, AtomicInteger, and many assert variants)\n- Remove unused fields (`headerMap`, `values`) not referenced by this test\n- Remove unused `validateMap` helper method (dead code in this file)\n- Add static import for `CSVRecordTest.EnumHeader` (which the original was missing — needed for compilation)\n- Add descriptive assertion failure messages to clarify intent`CSVRecordTest` is not on the compile classpath, so I can't import its inner enum. The fix is to define `EnumHeader` locally in the test file."
